# ============================================
# CONDITIONAL SUBSYSTEM OBJECTS
# ============================================
# Controlled by .config (generated by menuconfig).
# Pattern: ifneq(…,n) makes the subsystem compile when the variable
# is empty (no .config) OR "y", keeping the build backward-compatible.

# Networking (IPv4 stack + RTL8139 NIC driver)
